# The repo tracks only what the Cloudflare Worker serves and deploys; SHIP.md lists it (and, like every .md, stays local).
# Everything below is local-only. These files still exist on disk, so .assetsignore lists them too —
# otherwise `wrangler deploy` from this folder would publish them.

# the osrs-r2 cache transcode (~1.9GB): served beside the game for now, remapped to R2 later; never committed
out/

# notes and docs
*.md

# build tooling and its inputs: the bakers, the Gielinor map builder, the icon pipeline, the dev server and harness
tools/
mapgen.mjs
icons07-*.mjs
icons07-*.csv

# local state and dev conveniences
.wrangler/
node_modules/
.claude/
.rgignore
play-local.cmd

# retired: the temporary wiki sprite dumps, and the model bundle osrs.js no longer reads (it streams out/)
assets/c07-full2/
assets/i07-full2/
assets/osrs/
